        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonywol, wikiri wikuri nyithindho mewin i yo ma miyo jo nge. Kucel, fonji win jo jowodongi i tim mabeyo kodi i fonji pa Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋecin kodi rwodhe pajo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.22+COL.3.23+COL.3.24+COL.3.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:22-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋecin, winji win rwodhe mewin ma piny ka, gi lworo kodi kirin; aka witim tic gi cuny win acel, paŋini witimo ri Kristo won gipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Winji win jo, ki nyaka ni jowofoy win ka joneno win, to tiyi win paka jotic pa Kristo, ma jotimo gima Were yenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim win tic mewin gi kisangala, paŋini witiyo ri Rwoth, makiweno ri ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poyi win ni Rwoth bino miyo dhano je kemba, kada bedi ŋeca kosa ŋata ni siem, ro tic pere maber ma go otimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 10:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo rwodhe, wibende kuri win ŋecin mewin ameno. Weyi win bwoko jo paka wiŋeyo ni win kodi ŋecin mewin je wibedo apa Rwoth acel i polo, ma thumo banja ri dhano je m'ongoye yero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gilweny pa Were gipi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Macowe, bedi win ma wicwiny i Rwoth, kanyacel gi i meni pere m'oasere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruki win gilweny je ma Were poko, aka nyaka winonyali cungo matek gi ciro bwo pa jwogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato wakilweny gi ji wadi wan, to gi jodhum moro, gi rwodhe moro, kodi jomeni ma colo ma piny me, kodi jodhum mareco ma cuny, ma wi hongo malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo ruki win gilweny pa Were gipi, ŋey ka ndelo ma raco otundi, wibino nyalo ciro lweny pa jakwor, aka ka witieko lwenyo kiri i gike, bino nwaŋo ni fodi witek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.11.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 11:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 59:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo cungi win matek, aka adieri ama wobedi del m'othoko pier win, tiro ama wiruki paka kwot ma nyweny i dakoriwin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 52:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka yikirok ma tito Wac Manyen Maber ma kelo siem wobedi war ma tiendi win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Medo kwoŋ gigipiny no je, tiŋi win yeyo paka kwot mewin; meno ama wibino geŋo gi kweyo gine asere maliel mac ma Ŋatarac obay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 59:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kethi win both paka junga ma gwoko wiy win, aka wac pa Were paka abor ma Cuny Maleŋ miyo win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka bedi win i kwayo, munyo wikwayo kony pa Were i royo m'omore hongo je, paka Cuny nyutho win. Am'omiyo bedi win milengela aka wikiri wilacere ndir je, to kway win ri ji pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kway win ran bende ni Were womiyan mikwenda ka ayikere luwo, ŋey aluwi gi miseni k'amiyo ji ŋeyo nyaliŋliŋ ma Wac Manyen Maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole abedo jamikwenda ma Wac Manyen Maber kada pama anitie i twec. Kway win ni abedi gi miseni ma luwo wac no paka ripo atimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Moth macowe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
